menu "Echoy diagnostic build"
config ECHOY_AUDIO_DIAGNOSTICS
    bool "Enable explicit audio readback and one-second reference-tone RPC"
    default n
    help
        Adds private ESP-Iris service 0xECA0 for controlled device bring-up.
        Never plays automatically. Method 1 reads cached state, 2 requests a
        fixed one-second 1 kHz tone, and 3 cancels it. Music is paused and never
        resumed automatically. Keep disabled in normal product builds.
config ECHOY_OUTPUT_MEASUREMENT
    bool "Enable explicitly authorized bounded microphone/output measurement"
    depends on !ECHOY_AUDIO_DIAGNOSTICS
    default n
    help
        Temporary private service 0xECA2. Explicit start only, fixed 10.5-second
        speaker test and microphone capture, with a 12-second deadline and at
        most two starts per boot. The host also enforces the consent budget
        across boots. Pause cancels; completion never resumes music. Keep
        disabled in ordinary builds. Enabling this is not capture consent.
endmenu

menu "Echoy device audio trials"
config ECHOY_HARMONY_BASS_TRIAL
    bool "Apply the approved 500 Hz Harmony bass-cut trial to prepared loops"
    default n
    help
        Filters only the normalized Harmony FULL loop before the existing role
        gain. Runs during background sound preparation, never on the PCM owner.
        Other roles, notes, timing, UI volume and the .60 output ceiling remain
        unchanged. No gain compensation and no microphone capture. Keep off
        for ordinary releases until physical listening acceptance is complete.
endmenu
